              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli ekinaagemanga ku mamba yaakyo, kinaakolwangaku amaani ag'obutukuvu bwakyo. Era ekivaalo ekinaamansirwangaku omusaayi gwakyo, banaakyolezanga mu kifo ekitukuvu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entamu ey'eitosi efumbiibwamu emamba yaakyo, enaamenhebwanga. Aye entamu ey'ekyuma eky'ekikomo bw'enaabanga nga n'efumbiibwamu emamba yaakyo, enaakolokotebwanga yaanaazibwa n'amaadhi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiisi musaadha ow'oku lulyo lwa Aaroni, anaabanga wa idembe okukiryaku. Kitukuvu inho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye omusaayi gwakyo bwe gunaaleetebwanga mu Weema ey'Okwagaananirangamu ni Musengwa Katonda, era ni gukozesebwa mu musengo ogugheebwayo olw'ebibi, olwo tikiiriibwengaku kinaayokebwanga bwokebwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.30",
